# Overnight Delivery (windurst 15): the six o'clock edges. Accepted by GM (Prog 4). Kotan at 06:00 of the next day: day
# (144: `< 6` is false at 6). At 05:00 of the day after: night, 141; the finish runs at 06:00 (`wait vana=1` while 141
# is open), so its `VanadielHour() < 6` is false: dueDate = today + 1. At 06:00 of the due day Kenapa takes the bag
# late (`dueDate == today and hour < 6` false): 346 (the quest deleted, the bag gone, dueDate 0, Prog 256). Available
# again: 347 (Prog 0) at 06:00 (the 256 line comes before the hour check), then at Prog 0 and 06:00 nothing (`hour >= 7`
# false: his script), and at 07:00 the offer 336.
lists WindurstWaters/Kenapa-Keppa/onTrigger Mhaura/Kotan-Purutan/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/346 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/347 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/336 Mhaura/onEventFinish/141
